// The cool-down screen (spec, "A session", step 4): where confidence was off, one line to your earlier self, and what comes back next session. The facts are the lines of session_cool_down_text, read from the log by the engine layer; this only lays them out.

// Draw the cool-down screen's cards and captions. The note box is a widget drawn last.
gym_paint_cool(Session gym_state) {
  gym_paint_off(gym_state);
  gym_paint_note(gym_state);
  gym_paint_due(gym_state);
} return void;
